-meeting date is an MVP-2 placeholder).","Relative-strength inflection vs its sector index."],"caveats":["Thinly traded \u2014 median ~\u20b90.29 cr/day (< \u20b91 cr); signals/exits may slip.","corporate-action gaps, illiquid names, or a short listing history can distort returns/DMA/RS."],"confidence":"low","disclaimer":"Diagnostics only \u2014 a structured reading of price behaviour, business fundamentals, valuation and ownership for your OWN judgement. This is NOT a buy/sell/hold recommendation.","method":"Each dimension is a transparent points tally of the named signals listed beneath it \u2014 open a dimension to see the exact signals that fired and its rule. Verdict = positive at +2 or more / negative at \u22122 or less for Market, Business and Valuation; \u00b11 for Ownership. A 'positive' valuation means the multiple looks supportive vs the stock's OWN history \u2014 never a buy call."},"data_quality":{"price_asof":"2026-09-24","fundamentals_fetched":"2026-06-24","has_fundamentals":false,"has_shareholding":false,"liquidity_warning":"Thinly traded \u2014 median ~\u20b90.29 cr/day (< \u20b91 cr); signals/exits may slip.","note":"Market data is daily and current; fundamentals & shareholding are as of the last cached Screener fetch (quarterly/annual). Confidence is lower for thin or short-history names."},"delivery":{"d":[20250327,20250328,20250401,20250402,20250403,20250404,20250407,20250408,20250409,20250411,20250415,20250416,20250417,20250421,20250422,20250423,20250424,20250425,20250428,20250429,20250430,20250502,20250505,20250506,20250507,20250508,20250509,20250512,20250513,20250514,20250515,20250516,20250519,20250520,20250521,20250522,20250523,20250526,20250527,20250528,20250529,20250530,20250602,20250603,20250604,20250605,20250606,20250609,20250610,20250611,20250612,20250613,20250616,20250617,20250618,20250619,20250620,20250623,20250624,20250625,20250626,20250627,20250630,20250701,20250702,20250703,20250704,20250707,20250708,20250709,20250710,20250711,2025